OL,3,GNEWSASex assault trial date set for
OL,4,Aformer council leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FA date has been set for the trial of a
OL,7,Fformer council leader in
OL,8,FLeicestershire, who is accused of
OL,9,Fsexually assaulting a woman.
OL,11,FPhilip Allnatt, from Melton Mowbray,
OL,12,Fappeared at Leicester Crown Court on
OL,13,FMonday, charged with sexual assault in
OL,14,FFebruary.
OL,16,FThe 76-year-old was the leader of
OL,17,FMelton Borough Council from May 2023
OL,18,Fand announced he would step down as
OL,19,Fleader in April. He currently
OL,20,Frepresents the Melton Egerton ward.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
