OL,3,GNEWSASex assault trial date set for
OL,4,Aformer council leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the court hearing, Allnatt spoke
OL,7,Fonly to confirm his name and to deny
OL,8,Fthe charge. A three-day trial was
OL,9,Flisted to start on 3 April 2028.
